[{"client_msg_id":"69bce97a-54f9-4311-ac52-8337f8cdf16e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Pythonで書くのシェル叩くのが面倒ですけど自由度は大分高いですね","ts":"1614918017.118100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"554"}]},{"client_msg_id":"249bf54e-6a27-4f5c-83c0-3b7f767df654","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ですねー、ただ非推奨って言われてるしまぁfilter-repoでいいかな感は","ts":"1614917681.117700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2CxBo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e39da30-1d2b-4a75-b7d8-887dfa73fa7b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど...しかし原因がナゾのままっぽさでますね...","ts":"1614917449.117300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+acAl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f22b160-5b55-4fef-b5b1-4891d8ca5f53","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ git filter-repo --force --refs main..HEAD --message-callback '\n  if not re.match(b\"GH-[0-9]*: \", message):\n    pr_number = subprocess.check_output(\"hub pr show -f %I\", shell=True)\n    message = b\"GH-\" + pr_number.strip() + b\": \" + message\n  return message'```\npython便利","ts":"1614917172.116700","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1614917270.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0syJC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a577891d-6592-4853-bad6-7ce52b2da60a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"filter-repoでいけました！！！","ts":"1614917162.116300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XJsXJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d36310d-cbf1-43eb-a78b-d33c4186ff6a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"結果としては多分これで問題ないはず、他の人も末尾に付くかが気になるところ・・・","ts":"1614915133.116000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LEZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f623335a-6b69-403a-930a-9466028db80f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"再度確認したら `?` 付けててもreplaceだから正規表現自体は\n`$ git log --oneline | head -n 4 | cut -d\" \" -f2- | sd \"^(GH-[0-9]+: )?\" \"GH-$(hub pr show -f \"%I\"): \"`\nで目的のものになってました\n結局これで末尾に付く問題が解決できたらよさそう・・・","ts":"1614915106.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n8BSY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91085668-e3fd-4725-b644-f8658ed15729","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"（高速化が犠牲になる恐れはあります）","ts":"1614915100.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HFrqL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e516de1a-911a-4ef9-98a1-54b0bd5ba980","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"先読み（`?!`）使う場合 pcre エンジン使わないといけないので、\n`-P` オプションは必要かと思います。","ts":"1614915045.113900","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1614915069.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rDvfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d32307b-427c-4fea-95fb-e3fa8226d31e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"~denoで書きたい~","ts":"1614914688.112600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Df+c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a5cc349-498b-44a8-8b84-06ed7c4a33e0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最初の行か、だったらシェルスクリプト噛ませたほうがよさそう?\n\u003chttps://www.hiroom2.com/2015/07/09/git-filter-branch%E3%81%A7%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%82%92%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E5%A4%89%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B/|https://www.hiroom2.com/2015/07/09/git-filter-branch%E3%81%A7%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%8[…]%82%92%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E5%A4%89%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B/\u003e\nの `insert_ticket_number.sh`  みたいに","ts":"1614914614.112300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Narrow Escape: git filter-branchでコミットを一括変換する","id":1,"title":"git filter-branchでコミットを一括変換する","title_link":"https://www.hiroom2.com/2015/07/09/git-filter-branch%E3%81%A7%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%82%92%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E5%A4%89%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B/","text":"git filter-branchでコミットのメッセージやメールアドレス・名前の変更する方法をまとめました。","blocks":null,"ts":1436495040,"service_name":"Narrow Escape","from_url":"https://www.hiroom2.com/2015/07/09/git-filter-branch%E3%81%A7%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%82%92%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E5%A4%89%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B/","original_url":"https://www.hiroom2.com/2015/07/09/git-filter-branch%E3%81%A7%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%82%92%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E5%A4%89%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v3/I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb27c964-523f-4729-920f-842fbb836dda","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; `?!` 使えない？\nripgrep は後読み、先読みは使えなかったような","ts":"1614914613.112200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PL9p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"711b1c29-c8e9-4b2a-9166-d8a0c3bfc87e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"?を消すとそもそも付かないのかー、うーん","ts":"1614914563.111000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b722X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43f3050-d388-465f-b5c2-818f39ed3f83","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"むずい・・・","ts":"1614914541.110400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K71K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"556ed948-f3bd-4971-9bc5-308698e78e8a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、 また?が余計か","ts":"1614914522.110100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ad"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec457e79-4a4e-4d42-a6e4-399dee58fa90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"んー、それだと付きそう\n`\"^(!?GH-[0-9]+: )?\"` って、「先頭で、次にGHがない、かもしれない行にマッチ」になりそうだけど","ts":"1614914491.109400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d+j1N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bdd7cd7-a346-4157-bda4-e8bc4f7c72a7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"末尾に付く意味が分からん・・・","ts":"1614914271.108600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c522e399-62d2-4068-a69a-ca67451cca74","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"先に試してたやつをやってみて\n`$ FILTER_BRANCH_SQUELCH_WARNING=1 git filter-branch -f --msg-filter 'rg \"^(!?GH-[0-9]+: )?\" --replace \"GH-$(hub pr show -f \"%I\"): \"' master..HEAD`\nでいけたんだけど末尾にもやっぱり付く","ts":"1614914267.108400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=+qq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0bab2cf-c0a6-4301-bc14-a559132562f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、そもそも-vでいけるのかな","ts":"1614914021.107900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W92zZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"685b19ae-5945-4c35-adb2-12c2a99ddfbe","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"rg -v (--invert-match) ?","ts":"1614913965.107600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c374374f-a731-4b50-b77b-6d28406c738a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、でもどっちにしても末尾に `GH-{num}` が混入するのは別問題かもしれない、辛い","ts":"1614913705.107300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7nKc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30021842-61d4-4940-bdcb-9c4ca386a4fb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"rgで`not '^GH-{num}'` を `GH-{num}` にする正規表現が書けたら勝ちな気がする","ts":"1614913598.106700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L6J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a497b4e3-e3e1-4dd0-9783-e2b4c90ab223","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`?!` 使えない？","ts":"1614913510.105300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f500a0d1-1ccc-4028-8c65-3c98bd8c4619","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"正規表現の否定ってどうやるんだっけ・・・","ts":"1614913412.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z1m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4a33896-e8c9-432b-a090-a9978a7cbbf9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いや、逆か\n自分の正規表現がおかしい","ts":"1614913397.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rz7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d436c4c7-9808-47f3-96aa-de3d7cb73950","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"むー","ts":"1614913335.104200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4U8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b052072-e95a-4bdc-8977-6bad07c92497","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"rgと出力は違うけど結果としては同じ問題が起きるっていう","ts":"1614913312.103900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2o/VV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be519b93-b00d-403c-95b6-8a204e1b0ff2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ただもう1つ意味不明な問題があって\n`$ git log --oneline | head -n 4 | cut -d\" \" -f2- | sd \"^(GH-[1-9]+: )\" \"GH-$(hub pr show -f \"%I\"): \"`\nでsdを使って置換してみたら正しい4行しか出ないんですけど、これをfilter-branchに渡すとこっちでも末尾に `GH-{num}` が付くんですよね・・・","ts":"1614913282.103500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1614913358.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5x+xI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c0f8c97-6bce-4a90-8466-e54f8c309e85","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、`?` は不要でした。多分付けてないのを実行してhistoryから貼ったのが間違えてる。","ts":"1614913247.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Hm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5d91bfa-9d01-48db-b675-fc5be2e93f53","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`^(GH-[1-9]+: )?` だと行頭すべてにマッチしそうだけど？","ts":"1614913205.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gosgy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a16188d-c643-43df-875f-60dc1709c4c9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"じゃあ、filter-branchはそのままやってるっぽいね、rgの問題を解決すればいいのかな","ts":"1614913154.101200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L95"}]},{"client_msg_id":"685a7eff-ebaf-4618-96a4-1b83d41adbec","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"rgしない場合は間の行出ないです","ts":"1614913147.100900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wMo3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a514fee4-47ba-4884-b36b-9dd9e04c0bc2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`$ git log --oneline | head -n 4 | cut -d\" \" -f2- | rg \"^(GH-[1-9]+: )?\" --replace \"GH-$(hub pr show -f \"%I\"): \"`\nで試してるんですが\n```GH-{num}: {old_message1}\nGH-{num}:\nGH-{num}: {old_message2}\nGH-{num}:\nGH-{num}: {old_message3}\nGH-{num}:\nGH-{num}: {old_message4}\nGH-{num}:```\nってなるんですよね","ts":"1614913128.100400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gc7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3af1fd7d-003a-41f8-b627-47f251ebb231","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"えーっと、これもちょっと意味が分からない挙動になってて","ts":"1614913067.099900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+AkvE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd17e265-d484-42c6-b54f-9f4dfaf4f152","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"素でのrgでやったときは大丈夫そう?","ts":"1614913040.099600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+KNY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db1ddd13-4a6a-4a18-be4a-4ca0d7b54a79","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`$ FILTER_BRANCH_SQUELCH_WARNING=1 git filter-branch -f --msg-filter 'rg \"^(GH-[1-9]+: )?\" -r \"GH-$(hub pr show -f \"%I\"): \"' master..HEAD`\nしてるんですが、 `GH-{num}: {old_message} GH:-{num}` になっちゃう原因って分かるでしょうか\n意味不明で困ってる・・・","ts":"1614912954.099300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54264913-e4d1-4d08-966e-87b0e92d6169","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これsedとかrgとかsdの置換で試したんだけど、何故か末尾にも同じテキストが入る・・・","ts":"1614912799.098200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+GcL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe31d926-bd19-4bc1-8359-94441d9df08a","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"bash で削るなら、こんな感じだけど、 `:` みたいに終端に使える記号がないと正規表現の `/^GH-\\d+/` みたいなことはできないので厳しそう。\n```$ V='GH-123: foo: bar' bash -c 'echo ${V#GH-*:}'\nfoo: bar```","ts":"1614873327.097600","edited":{"user":"UBRTB4N5C","ts":"1614873351.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6vV"}]}]
